    "text": {
     "en": "Many plants have flowers. A flower later becomes a fruit.\nThe jamun tree has tiny white flowers. After some days, green fruits come, which become red and finally purple when ripe.\nInside many fruits there are seeds. A seed can grow into a new plant.\nFlowers come in many colours and sizes like rose, marigold, hibiscus and tulip.\nFruits like mango and jamun are tasty. We should wash fruits before eating."
    }
